[38;2;255;255;255m   [2m[39m└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[0m[38;2;255;255;255m

   [39mThat is the whole loop. To land a change:[38;2;255;255;255m

   [2m[39m1.[0m Run the checks:[38;2;255;255;255m
   [39m  [2m┌ sh ─────────────┐[0m[38;2;255;255;255m
   [39m  [2m│[0m deno task check [2m│[0m[38;2;255;255;255m
   [39m  [2m└─────────────────┘[0m[38;2;255;255;255m
   [2m[39m2.[0m Commit on main once every check has passed and the tree is clean, so whoever picks the work up next starts from[38;2;255;255;255m
   [39m  a build that runs.[38;2;255;255;255m

   [39mThen build the binary with:[38;2;255;255;255m

   [2m[39m┌ sh ─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐[0m[38;2;255;255;255m
   [2m[39m│[0m deno task compile --all                             [2m│[0m[38;2;255;255;255m
   [2m[39m│[0m for bin in dist/*/chord; do echo "built $bin"; done [2m│[0m[38;2;255;255;255m
   [2m[39m└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[0m[38;2;255;255;255m

